SUMMARY:Halloween Dance Party and Scavenger Hunt
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**It's a Halloween Dance Part
 y and Scavenger Hunt!**\n\n**Location: Party Room 51 Trolley Crescent**\n*
 *(Scavenger Hunt is under the bridge)**\n\n**Non-refundable fee:**\n*****2
 0 by October 19th********\n**25 from October 20th to 28th\n\n**Party Detai
 ls**\n***Theme**: Unmask your hidden self.*\n*** Vibe*: Grown-up drinks\, 
 killer costumes\, and zero filters.\n\n**Drop the mask and let your true m
 onster out to play this Halloween.**\nPrize for best costume!\nEvery day w
 e wear the mask of the professional\, the polite\, and the responsible. No
 t tonight. This Halloween\, it’s time to shed your civilized skin and un
 leash your **real personality**—no filters\, no judgements\, just pure\,
  unadulterated fun.\nCome as who you *actually* are on the inside.\n🖤 T
 he Ritual\n\n*** Date: **Saturday\, October 31st\, 2026\n*** Time: **7:00 
 PM until the spirits fade**\n*** Lair: We are just confirming the venue. W
 e will keep you posted!\n\n🍷 The Elements\n\n*** Potions & Brews: **Dri
 nks and nibbles provided!\n*** Attire: **Costumes required. Dress as your 
 inner alter-ego\, your deepest obsession\, or the version of you that only
  comes out after dark.\n*** The Vibe: **Dark beats\, heavy pours\, and wic
 ked company.\nADMISSION IS $20\,\n\nAre you brave enough to show your true
  colours?
