SUMMARY:Jon is taking you on a 18km hike! Be Prepared!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**Meetup Point: 1401 Brock Rd
 \, Uxbridge\, ON L0C 1A0**\n\nWhile we have done this area before\, this i
 s a new trail and a long one. It will be a full 18km hike at a reasonable 
 pace so come prepared for a good days hike. The trail is really pretty and
  peaceful so it makes for a great full day hike outdoors. There are some h
 ills but its the perfect way to get you ready for winter hiking as we hike
  all year\, rains\, shine\, sleet or snow like the postman!\n\nThis is not
  a beginner hike. Its not that difficult but you do need stamina to go the
  distance. Come with good shoes\, plenty of water and snacks!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/these-boots-are-made-for-hiking/event
 s/317047772/
